  {
    "key": "grammar:g-le:ex0",
    "text": "我吃了两个苹果。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-le:ex1",
    "text": "他走了。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-zai-prog:ex0",
    "text": "我在看书呢。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-zai-prog:ex1",
    "text": "他们正在上课。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-yao-xiang:ex0",
    "text": "我想学汉语。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-yao-xiang:ex1",
    "text": "我要这个。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-hui-neng-keyi:ex0",
    "text": "我会游泳。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-hui-neng-keyi:ex1",
    "text": "这里可以拍照吗？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-guo:ex0",
    "text": "你吃过北京烤鸭吗？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-guo:ex1",
    "text": "我没学过日语。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-comparative-bi:ex0",
    "text": "汉语比英语难。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-comparative-bi:ex1",
    "text": "他比我大三岁。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-yinwei-suoyi:ex0",
    "text": "因为我喜欢中国文化，所以学汉语。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-zhengzai-ne:ex0",
    "text": "我喝咖啡，你呢？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-resultative:ex0",
    "text": "我听懂了。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-resultative:ex1",
    "text": "作业我做完了。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-ba:ex0",
    "text": "请把门关上。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-ba:ex1",
    "text": "我把作业做完了。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-de-complement:ex0",
    "text": "她汉语说得很流利。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-directional:ex0",
    "text": "他回家去了。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-directional:ex1",
    "text": "请坐下。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-shi-de:ex0",
    "text": "我是在北京学的汉语。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-yijing-hai:ex0",
    "text": "我已经做完作业了。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:g-yijing-hai:ex1",
    "text": "他还没起床呢。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:tocfl-n1-le-change:ex0",
    "text": "下雨了。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:tocfl-n1-le-change:ex1",
    "text": "我饿了。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:tocfl-n2-hui-ability:ex0",
    "text": "我會說一點中文。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "grammar:tocfl-n2-hui-ability:ex1",
    "text": "明天會下雨。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-wo-de-yitian:p0",
    "text": "我叫安娜，我是学生。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-wo-de-yitian:p1",
    "text": "我七点起床，喝一杯咖啡。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-wo-de-yitian:p2",
    "text": "我很喜欢学汉语。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-wo-de-yitian:p3",
    "text": "晚上我看书，十一点睡觉。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-zai-fandian:p0",
    "text": "你好！你要什么？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-zai-fandian:p1",
    "text": "我要米饭和茶。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-zai-fandian:p2",
    "text": "好的。一共十五块。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-zai-fandian:p3",
    "text": "谢谢！",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-wo-de-jia:p0",
    "text": "我家有四个人：爸爸、妈妈、弟弟和我。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-wo-de-jia:p1",
    "text": "爸爸是老师，妈妈是医生。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-wo-de-jia:p2",
    "text": "弟弟很小，他六岁。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-wo-de-jia:p3",
    "text": "我们都很爱我们的家。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-chunjie:p0",
    "text": "春节是中国最重要的节日。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-chunjie:p1",
    "text": "春节的时候，人们回家看爸爸妈妈。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-chunjie:p2",
    "text": "大家一起吃饭，孩子们有红包。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-chunjie:p3",
    "text": "人们说：新年快乐！",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-xuexi-hanyu:p0",
    "text": "现在很多人学习汉语。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-xuexi-hanyu:p1",
    "text": "有的人因为工作，有的人因为喜欢中国文化。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-xuexi-hanyu:p2",
    "text": "汉语不容易，可是很有意思。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-xuexi-hanyu:p3",
    "text": "每天学习一点儿，就会越来越好。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-tocfl-n1-wo-de-jia:p0",
    "text": "我家有三個人：爸爸、媽媽和我。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-tocfl-n1-wo-de-jia:p1",
    "text": "爸爸是工程師，媽媽是老師。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-tocfl-n1-wo-de-jia:p2",
    "text": "我們住在台北，台北是一個很漂亮的城市。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-tocfl-n1-wo-de-jia:p3",
    "text": "我愛我的家。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-tocfl-n2-tai-bei-yi-ri:p0",
    "text": "上個星期六，我和朋友去台北玩。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-tocfl-n2-tai-bei-yi-ri:p1",
    "text": "我們先去了故宮博物院，看到了很多古老的東西。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-tocfl-n2-tai-bei-yi-ri:p2",
    "text": "中午我們去吃了一碗牛肉麵，很好吃。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "reading:r-tocfl-n2-tai-bei-yi-ri:p3",
    "text": "下午我們去了象山，從山上看台北非常漂亮。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "female"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-introduce-self:t0",
    "text": "你好！我叫李明。你叫什么名字？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-introduce-self:t2",
    "text": "很高兴认识你！你是哪国人？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-introduce-self:t4",
    "text": "太好了！我们一起学习吧。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-order-food:t0",
    "text": "欢迎！你要什么？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-order-food:t2",
    "text": "好的。要喝水吗？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-order-food:t4",
    "text": "好，请等一下。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-buying:t0",
    "text": "你好！要买什么？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-buying:t2",
    "text": "八块钱。很好吃！",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-buying:t4",
    "text": "十六块。谢谢！",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-directions:t0",
    "text": "你好，需要帮助吗？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-directions:t2",
    "text": "地铁站不远，一直走，五分钟就到。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-hotel:t0",
    "text": "晚上好！欢迎光临。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-hotel:t2",
    "text": "好的，安娜女士。您的房间是三零五。",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-hotel:t4",
    "text": "早上七点到十点。祝您入住愉快！",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-making-friends:t0",
    "text": "你也喜欢这家咖啡店吗？",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-making-friends:t2",
    "text": "我每天都来！你是留学生吧？你的汉语很好！",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-making-friends:t4",
    "text": "我们加个微信吧，以后一起练习！",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "hsk",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-tocfl-n1-zai-jie-shang:t0",
    "text": "你好！請問你要去哪裡？",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-tocfl-n1-zai-jie-shang:t2",
    "text": "往前走，在第二個路口左轉就到了。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-tocfl-n1-zai-jie-shang:t4",
    "text": "不客氣！祝你玩得開心！",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-tocfl-n2-dian-can:t0",
    "text": "您好！這是菜單。請問您想吃什麼？",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-tocfl-n2-dian-can:t2",
    "text": "好的，牛肉麵和珍珠奶茶。還需要別的嗎？",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
    "key": "conv:conv-tocfl-n2-dian-can:t4",
    "text": "請稍等，馬上就來。",
    "locale": "zh-TW",
    "language": "zh",
    "examSource": "tocfl",
    "gender": "male"
  },
  {
